===Etymology 3===
Representing a frequentative form of {{m|en|spit#Etymology_3|t=a spade's depth}}, equivalent to {{suf|en|spit#Etymology_3|le}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# A small sort of [[spade]].

====Verb====
{{en-verb|spittl}}

# To dig or stir with a small spade.

